[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19981.19, "timestamp": "05:33:01", "text": "在。这的确很痛苦，但事情就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19983.19, "timestamp": "05:33:03", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19985.06, "timestamp": "05:33:05", "text": "这正是它所需要的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19987.39, "timestamp": "05:33:07", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19992.15, "timestamp": "05:33:12", "text": "是的。所以，嗯，到底是什么事？哦，我还没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19995.43, "timestamp": "05:33:15", "text": "我觉得没问题。是的。让我来做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20000.628, "timestamp": "05:33:20", "text": "你知道吗，有趣的是我觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20002.788, "timestamp": "05:33:22", "text": "我应该，你知道，我知道我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20004.708, "timestamp": "05:33:24", "text": "分享一下，但我也觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20007.35, "timestamp": "05:33:27", "text": "就像我应该让链接失效一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20016.8, "timestamp": "05:33:36", "text": "你好。我看看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20024.788, "timestamp": "05:33:44", "text": "真是令人难过。别，永远别出现在我的世界里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20027.27, "timestamp": "05:33:47", "text": "各位，站好位置。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20035.11, "timestamp": "05:33:55", "text": "所以，就跟着节目走吧。是的，就是它的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20037.15, "timestamp": "05:33:57", "text": "一切都很好，但这也太过了。"}]